<milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> </div> <div n="2"> <head> <hi rendition="#g">Dreyzehntes Kapitel</hi>.<lb/>
</head> <milestone unit="section" rendition="#hr"/> <p>Es war ein &#x017F;chöner Herb&#x017F;tmorgen, da ritt Frie¬<lb/>
